<h1>Reset your Wheelhouse password</h1>

<p>
  Somebody asked for a new password for <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>
  at Wheelhouse, the workshop's repair tracking system.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>
</p>

<p>
  The link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>,
  and stops working once the password is changed.
</p>

<p>
  If this was not you, ignore this message: the password has not changed.
</p>

<p>— Wheelhouse</p>
